    {
      "target": "lesson.prose[11]",
      "kind": "p",
      "source_refs": [
        "p0183#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "如果力的功与物体的路径无关，则功等于物体势能变化量的负值(在八年级物理课程中曾详细地讲过这点). 因此，",
      "modern_text": "**功与电势能变化**。\n静电力是保守力，功等于相应电势能变化量的负值，和力学中的关系一致。\n因此，",
      "source_math": [],
      "modern_math": [],
      "exact_math_atoms_unchanged": true,
      "source_literal_digits_outside_math": [],
      "modern_literal_digits_outside_math": [],
      "literal_numeric_tokens_unchanged": true,
      "changes": [
        "wording",
